# BYTE_STR — bytes / ord / bitwise residual honesty (M166)

Path-A product: `ord` and integer bitwise ops (`&` `|` `^` `<<` `>>`) where wired in emit/runtime.

## Residual (honest)

- **no float bit** operations as product (float bitcast / float rotate not claimed)
- **no rotate** product surface (rol/ror residual)
- Bitwise on floats is residual refuse

See also FLOOR.oot for Backend-C emit floor.
